# Accepted CVE findings.
#
# The Trivy job fails the build on CRITICAL/HIGH findings (see
# .github/workflows/pr-trivy.yml). Entries here are deliberate, reviewed
# exceptions. Each one must record the affected package, the version that
# fixes it, why it is not fixed yet, and an expiry date.
#
# Every entry below is a transitive dependency of Iceberg 1.10.0 or Confluent
# 7.9.4. Upgrading them means overriding a version our upstreams pin, so each
# needs its own compatibility testing rather than a blind bump.
#
# Review these on or before the expiry date. Do not add an entry without one.

# io.airlift:aircompressor 0.27 -> fixed in 2.0.3
# Reached via ursa-storage-lakehouse. Major-version bump; needs Iceberg/Delta
# compression compatibility testing.
CVE-2025-67721 exp:2026-11-30

# com.squareup.wire:wire-runtime-jvm 5.5.0 -> fixed in 6.3.0
# Reached via io.confluent:kafka-protobuf-provider:7.9.4. Major-version bump of
# a Confluent-pinned transitive; needs protobuf schema round-trip testing.
CVE-2026-45799 exp:2026-11-30

# org.apache.httpcomponents.core5:httpcore5 5.3.4 -> fixed in 5.4.3
# Reached via org.apache.iceberg:iceberg-core:1.10.0.
CVE-2026-54399 exp:2026-11-30

# org.apache.httpcomponents.core5:httpcore5-h2 5.3.4 -> fixed in 5.4.3
# Reached via org.apache.iceberg:iceberg-core:1.10.0.
CVE-2026-54428 exp:2026-11-30
